Data Visualization and Storytelling Using Python

Project Overview

This project focuses on transforming sales data into meaningful visual representations using Python. The objective is to communicate business insights clearly through charts and graphs.

Project Objectives

* Explore and understand sales data.
* Create appropriate visualizations.
* Identify product performance and monthly revenue trends.
* Examine coupon usage and customer purchasing behaviour.
* Communicate findings to support business decisions.

Tools and Technologies

* Python
* Pandas
* Matplotlib
* Seaborn
* Jupyter Notebook

Key Visualizations

1. Bar Chart – Top Products by Revenue
2. Line Chart – Monthly Revenue Trend
3. Pie Chart – Coupon Usage Distribution
4. Histogram – Order Value Distribution
5. Scatter Plot – Quantity versus Revenue

Key Insights

* Product revenue analysis helps identify high- and low-performing products.
* Monthly revenue trends reveal changes in sales performance over time.
* Coupon usage visualization helps assess promotional activity.
* Order value distribution reveals customer spending patterns.
* Quantity and revenue analysis helps examine purchasing behaviour.

Skills Demonstrated

* Data Visualization
* Exploratory Data Analysis
* Python Programming
* Data Interpretation
* Data Storytelling
* Business Insight Communication

Conclusion

This project strengthened my ability to use Python visualizations to explore sales data, communicate findings and support data-driven business decisions.
